      "optionsZhHans": [],
      "answer": "S_n = (4 * 3^n - 3n - 4)/2",
      "acceptedAnswers": [
        "S_n = (4 * 3^n - 3n - 4)/2",
        "S_n = (4·3^n - 3n - 4)/2",
        "S_n = (4×3^n - 3n - 4)/2"
      ],
      "explanationZhHans": "由 a_{n+1}=3a_n+4 得 a_{n+1}+2=3(a_n+2)，即 b_{n+1}=3b_n，b_1=4，故 {b_n} 是首项4公比3的等比数列，b_n=4·3^{n-1}，a_n=4·3^{n-1}-2。S_n=4(3^n-1)/(3-1)-2n=2·3^n-2-2n，整理得 S_n=(4·3^n-3n-4)/2。"
