      "promptZhHans": "已知数列 {a_n} 满足 a_1 = 1，a_{n+1} = 2a_n + 3^n，n ∈ N*。求数列 {a_n} 的通项公式。",
      "optionsZhHans": [],
      "answer": "a_n = 3^n - 2^n",
      "acceptedAnswers": [
        "a_n = 3^n - 2^n",
        "a_n=3^n-2^n"
      ],
      "explanationZhHans": "两边同除以 3^{n+1} 得 a_{n+1}/3^{n+1} = (2/3)·(a_n/3^n) + 1/3。令 b_n = a_n/3^n，则 b_{n+1} = (2/3)b_n + 1/3，构造等比：b_{n+1} - 1 = (2/3)(b_n - 1)。b_1 = 1/3，b_1 - 1 = -2/3，故 b_n - 1 = (-2/3)·(2/3)^{n-1} = -(2/3)^n，b_n = 1 - (2/3)^n，a_n = 3^n - 2^n。"
    },
